{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/31", "id": 5109544029, "node_id": "PR_kwDOVESuUM8AAAABMI10XQ", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/31", "diff_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/31.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/31.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/31", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/31/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/31/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/31/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/statuses/d35f60cfbe18a88a642fd9a4d56916fdbe3aede8", "number": 31, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Select the IOMMU address width required by the kernel in QEMU", "user": {"login": "aien-spark", "id": 330927100, "node_id": "U_kgDOE7mL_A", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330927100?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark", "html_url": "https://github.com/aien-spark", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "On QEMU 8.2.2, the launcher's default emulated IOMMU address width is 39, while `build_inactive_translation` requires the 48-bit-width capability. Boot stops at `inactive IOMMU translation construction failed`.\n\nSet `aw-bits=48` explicitly on the existing `intel-iommu` device. The kernel's isolation requirements and the boot suite remain unchanged.\n\nValidation: `make check`, `bash -n tools/qemu/run.sh` and the full `make test` boot suite pass on this standalone branch. Tested with QEMU 8.2.2, OVMF 2024.02, Rust 1.99.0 and Clang/LLD 18.1.3 on aarch64 Linux using x86-64 TCG emulation. The old profile also failed with the original upstream PE parser, confirming the failure is independent of the proposed parser change. This is emulator validation; physical hardware was not tested. The change adds no dependencies; formatting and licensing are unchanged.\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:59:15Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-01T23:43:50Z", "closed_at": "2026-11-01T23:43:50Z", "merged_at": "2026-11-01T23:43:50Z", "merge_commit_sha": "d7391923f5b9cc4a5e6c53e97bb53b1360e54b3f", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "aien-spark:fix/qemu-iommu-width", "ref": "fix/qemu-iommu-width", "repo": {"id": 1441894417, "node_id": "R_kgDOVfGQEQ", "name": "ginux", "full_name": "aien-spark/ginux", "owner": {"login": "aien-spark", "id": 330927100, "node_id": "U_kgDOE7mL_A", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/330927100?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark", "html_url": "https://github.com/aien-spark", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aien-spark/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com